sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI
    participant Agent as Agentic Loop
    participant LLM as LLM (Groq)
    participant Gate as Confirmation Gate
    participant MCP as MCP Client
    participant TAV as Tavily server
    participant Web
    participant FS as Filesystem server

    Note over User,FS: Auto mode. Task: "Find the latest FastAPI version and write NOTES.md with what's new."
    User->>CLI: /mode auto
    CLI->>Gate: auto_execute = True
    CLI-->>User: mode: auto (runs everything without asking)
    User->>CLI: types the task
    CLI->>Agent: run(task)
    Agent->>LLM: messages + tool schemas (stream)
    LLM-->>Agent: tool call: tavily__tavily_search("FastAPI latest release", max_results 3)
    Agent->>CLI: on_tool_start (cyan panel)
    Agent->>Gate: risky?
    Gate-->>Agent: no, run it
    Agent->>MCP: call_tool(tavily, tavily_search)
    MCP->>TAV: tools/call over HTTPS
    TAV->>Web: search
    Web-->>TAV: pages
    TAV-->>MCP: 3 results with URLs and snippets
    MCP-->>Agent: result (cut to 6,000 chars)
    Agent->>LLM: + tool result
    LLM-->>Agent: tool call: tavily__tavily_extract(release notes URL)
    Agent->>MCP: call_tool(tavily, tavily_extract)
    MCP->>TAV: tools/call
    TAV-->>Agent: page text (cut to 6,000 chars)
    Agent->>Agent: next request over budget, so older tool output is replaced by a short note
    Agent->>LLM: + tool result
    LLM-->>Agent: tool call: filesystem__write_file("NOTES.md", summary + link)
    Agent->>Gate: risky?
    Gate-->>Agent: yes, but auto mode: run without asking
    Agent->>MCP: call_tool(filesystem, write_file)
    MCP->>FS: tools/call
    FS-->>Agent: "Successfully wrote to NOTES.md"
    Agent->>LLM: + tool result
    LLM-->>Agent: final answer, streamed
    CLI-->>User: "corvus › The latest FastAPI release is ... I wrote a summary to NOTES.md."
